+## Optional TU7092 YouTube icon
+
+The TU7092 local port optionally bundles the unmodified red YouTube icon
+from https://brand.youtube/youtube-icon, member
+`YouTube_Icon/Digital/01 Red/yt_icon_red_digital.png` of the official icon pack.
+YouTube's name and icon remain their owner's trademarks and are subject to
+the linked brand guidelines; this artwork is not relicensed under MIT.
